            <ArticleTitle>The role of the anaesthetist in chronic pain management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>250-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The role of the anaesthetist in the continuing care of patients suffering from chronic pain has been discussed. Many of the techniques, both invasive and non-invasive, which are currently available for the treatment of chronic pain have been reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
